# Translated photo merge options.
photo_merge_advanced.projective = Alignment ya perspective (ezali na rotation) .
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = Panorama ya cylindrique
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = Longola bililingi ya mibale ya biloko oyo ezali kotambola (fɔtɔ ya liboso lokola référence)
photo_merge_advanced.focal = Longueur focale (px) / largeur ya image (px) .
photo_merge_advanced.masks = Elilingi oyo ebimi na kosangisa focus esalelaka ba masques ya ba kalke oyo ekoki kobongisama. Pona masque na Ba kalke mpe pakola yango langi mpo na kobongisa.
photo_merge_advanced.no_match = Alignment ya kotyela motema ezwami te. Salelá bafɔtɔ oyo ezali na makomi oyo ezali na bozindi monene mpe mbongwana ya moke na ndenge ya kotala.
photo_merge_advanced.invalid = Bilili ya source oyo ezali malamu te to ba paramètres ya kosangisa.
